{"4541320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Florence Mirror", "steam_appid": 4541320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/384560cab80f2744239ce652ada3686c.poster.avif?t=1784789133\" width=720 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/384560cab80f2744239ce652ada3686c.webm?t=1784789133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/384560cab80f2744239ce652ada3686c.mp4?t=1784789133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Florence Mirror</strong> is a dark fantasy Action RPG set in a modern-day Florence on the brink of collapse. Beneath its historic beauty lies a hidden mirror dimension, an ancient reflection where humanity’s sins and fears have taken monstrous form. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Leonardo Tornabuoni</strong>, the last descendant of a forgotten noble bloodline sworn to protect the seal between worlds. As the barrier weakens and creatures begin to spill into reality, you must reclaim your family’s lost power, confront the echoes of history, and restore balance before both realms are consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense, skill-based combat against over 30 unique bosses, each representing twisted aspects of human nature and society. Explore a city where past and present intertwine, encountering legendary historical figures and uncovering a deep, lore-rich narrative inspired by real events and hidden histories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blessed Path</strong> – a more accessible, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cursed Path</strong> – a brutal Souls-like mode demanding precision, mastery, and resilience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master arcane abilities, adapt your combat style, and survive in a world where every reflection could be a gateway to something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/222325a8eff071c0caf7d5d08e33e7b4.avif?t=1784789133\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark fantasy Action RPG with optional Souls-like difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ challenging bosses across main story, dungeons, and side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique setting blending modern Florence with a supernatural mirror dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich experience inspired by real historical figures and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep combat system focused on timing, positioning, and skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mirror is breaking. What waits on the other side is already watching.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/384560cab80f2744239ce652ada3686c.poster.avif?t=1784789133\" width=720 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/384560cab80f2744239ce652ada3686c.webm?t=1784789133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/384560cab80f2744239ce652ada3686c.mp4?t=1784789133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Florence Mirror</strong> is a dark fantasy Action RPG set in a modern-day Florence on the brink of collapse. Beneath its historic beauty lies a hidden mirror dimension, an ancient reflection where humanity’s sins and fears have taken monstrous form. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Leonardo Tornabuoni</strong>, the last descendant of a forgotten noble bloodline sworn to protect the seal between worlds. As the barrier weakens and creatures begin to spill into reality, you must reclaim your family’s lost power, confront the echoes of history, and restore balance before both realms are consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense, skill-based combat against over 30 unique bosses, each representing twisted aspects of human nature and society. Explore a city where past and present intertwine, encountering legendary historical figures and uncovering a deep, lore-rich narrative inspired by real events and hidden histories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blessed Path</strong> – a more accessible, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cursed Path</strong> – a brutal Souls-like mode demanding precision, mastery, and resilience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master arcane abilities, adapt your combat style, and survive in a world where every reflection could be a gateway to something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/extras/222325a8eff071c0caf7d5d08e33e7b4.avif?t=1784789133\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark fantasy Action RPG with optional Souls-like difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ challenging bosses across main story, dungeons, and side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique setting blending modern Florence with a supernatural mirror dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich experience inspired by real historical figures and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep combat system focused on timing, positioning, and skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mirror is breaking. What waits on the other side is already watching.</p>", "short_description": "Florence Mirror is a dark fantasy Action RPG set in modern Florence, where a hidden mirror dimension unleashes monstrous reflections of human sins. As Leonardo Tornabuoni, fight through 30+ bosses, master arcane powers, and choose between a story-driven path or a brutal Souls-like challenge.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/4132c19f6fb82a7435728dd040764e8bdf09005d/header.jpg?t=1784789133", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/77542adcd1350528d2108cf495f50796ba301d0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784789133", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541320/77542adcd1350528d2108cf495f50796ba301d0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784789133", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB video memory, shader model 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["FLOREGO"], "publishers": ["FLOREGO"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "de